        "id": "s1",
        "title": {
          "en": "A rule from old times",
          "hi": "पुराने समय का एक नियम"
        },
        "image": {
          "id": "should-rules-s1",
          "brief": "The Vetāla seated on a root reciting from memory with one finger raised, a faint glow of old palm-leaf lines in the air above him; Lubdhaka, tall and arms folded, sneering at the edge of the lamplight; you, Dādī and Śuka listening.",
          "alt": {
            "en": "A grey spirit recites an old verse while a tall man sneers at the edge of the lamplight",
            "hi": "पुराना श्लोक सुनाता भूत, दीपक की रोशनी के किनारे व्यंग्य से मुस्कराता लम्बा आदमी"
          },
          "text_in_image": [],
          "ratio": "4:3",
          "cast": [
            "vetala",
            "lubdhaka",
            "you",
            "dadi",
            "shuka"
          ],
          "place": "smashana"
        },
        "depth": "core",
        "skills": [],
        "sutras": [],
        "kind": "story",
        "narration": {
          "en": "Lubdhaka sneers: “Rules are for the weak.” The Vetāla opens one eye. “Rules,” he says, “are what the strong keep when no one is watching. Listen. This is a very old one.” He clears his throat and recites, slowly, a verse from the book of Manu.",
          "hi": "लुब्धक व्यंग्य से हँसता है: “नियम कमज़ोरों के लिए होते हैं।” वेताल एक आँख खोलता है। “नियम,” वह कहता है, “वे हैं जिन्हें बलवान तब निभाते हैं जब कोई नहीं देख रहा होता। सुनो। यह बहुत पुराना है।” वह गला साफ़ करता है और मनुस्मृति का एक श्लोक धीरे-धीरे सुनाता है।"
        },
        "lines": [],
        "quote": {
          "sa": "सत्यं ब्रूयात् प्रियं ब्रूयान् न ब्रूयात् सत्यम् अप्रियम् प्रियं च नानृतं ब्रूयाद् एष धर्मः सनातनः",
          "gloss": {
            "en": "One should speak the truth; one should speak what is pleasant; one should not speak an unpleasant truth; nor should one speak a pleasant lie. This is the eternal rule.",
            "hi": "सत्य बोलना चाहिए; प्रिय बोलना चाहिए; अप्रिय सत्य नहीं बोलना चाहिए; और प्रिय असत्य भी नहीं बोलना चाहिए। यही सनातन धर्म है।"
          },
          "source": "Manusmṛti 4.138 (read in the Digital Corpus of Sanskrit)"
        }
      },
      {
